10&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zqioQ7Ag4t0Q7kNvwGHcBs_&_nc_oc=AdoNf-hdK-zpmVwF-ILSRGwt_iqK4PWCzXY1YcS__uBUP7q0A0hVfGOIK2IPXXm8Q8s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRj1Rdinf7qP1kpkR-rF4M9ez7wfel4zIQyMRoeBe5jng&oe=6AF5D82F"}, "display_name": "Calculator Pro", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Calculator Pro in VR brings the simplicity and power of everyday calculations into the immersive world of virtual reality. Designed with clean visuals and intuitive controls, it provides a seamless way to solve and perform quick calculations, and handle both basic and advanced math tasks without breaking your VR experience.\n\nWhether you are a student, educator, professional, or just someone who needs a reliable calculator while working in VR, Calculator Pro offers an efficient and user\u2011friendly interface tailored for comfort and ease of use. The app ensures smooth interaction with clearly visible buttons, responsive input, and an organized display that makes calculations feel natural in a 3D space.\n\nFuture updates will expand its capabilities even further \u2014 including new layouts to best suits your workflow.\n\nWith Calculator Pro, math becomes immersive, practical, and always within reach.", "short_description": "Calculator Pro (VR) \u2013 A powerful and intuitive calculator built for virtual reality. Perform quick calculations in an immersive 3D environment with easy-to-use controls, and a sleek interface designed for comfort and efficiency. Perfect for students, professionals, and anyone who wants math made immersive."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/subritcalculatorpro/app-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Subrit Dikshit", "support_website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/subritcalculatorpro", "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/site/subrit/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags"